  "adjudication": [
    "All six materials and all six frozen representations pass the preregistered DOP853-versus-Radau numerical-resolution gate.",
    "After removing candidate Heun error and finite Reference temporal truncation, targeted placement remains supported on five of six materials at dimension four, with B05 as the persistent counterexample, and on all six materials at dimension eight.",
    "The targeted L4->L6->R8 ladder is componentwise nonworse at both transitions on all six materials. The prior B02 and B16 dimension tradeoffs were finite-time numerical artifacts and are superseded.",
    "For B11 and B12, groundwater exchange is already at or near the equal-grid temporal-limit residual by L6/R8 while profile reconstruction continues to improve with dimension; state dimension is therefore strongly purpose-dependent.",
