    "B02 and B16 reach the equal-grid exchange floor by R8, while B06 remains above it.",
    "R16_OP is not inside the inherited absolute identity floor on five materials, so B1HCM alone cannot label the remaining equal-grid residual as Layer-ROM model-form error."
